 13:54:57'),('f7289d22-6992-4069-bcea-731ecca41e02','Xanh dương',1899000.00,'100% vải cotton','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-so-mi-denim-khoa-keo-p07545426.html','4cff7e58-4834-449f-a174-8d05423b95d2','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('f91b6757-14ab-4e79-8ebf-9182bb07bcd9','màu trắng/ngọc lam',1199000.00,'25% vải poliamitLỚP LÓT | 25% vải poliamit | 75% sợi lyocell','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-so-mi-ke-soc-chiet-eo-p03100163.html','4364929b-dd83-433e-9b11-0b8b0b47f477','2026-03-26 13:54:58','2026-03-26 13:54:58'),('f955648c-08e8-4d35-a59b-25e0c0b5d394','Xanh dương/Chàm',2199000.00,'80% vải cotton | 20% vải lanh','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/quan-regular-fit-mong-nhe-p00840484.html','0e7ab391-bf93-45c4-8d1a-e8ead331e899','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('faf24ee8-e444-4264-b0cf-3a7a1962c527','Màu trắng ngà',1199000.00,'100% vải cotton','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-phong-vai-cotton-det-kim-mong-nhe-p05755460.html','b7382499-de8c-4cfd-9a55-67ab2cb33413','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('fbd07f2b-9782-4c3c-bd80-402651f25314','Màu nâu',1899000.00,'100% vải cotton','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-khoac-dang-rong-chan-chi-noi-khac-mau-p06987480.html','117ea19d-0531-4abd-8dd9-e54646d52297','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('fcd2ab3b-16de-41ae-829c-06d5e2f19bb0','Màu đen',1399000.00,'75% vải cotton | 25% vải lanh','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-phong-cotton---linen-phien-ban-gioi-han-p05372428.html','ae811569-c223-4581-a240-582145da37cb','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('fcfb69a9-5eb9-4752-ad92-c35dfb2beb2b','Màu trắng',699000.00,'2% elastane | 98% vải cotton','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/%C3%A1o-ph%C3%B4ng-medium-weight-c%C6%A1-b%E1%BA%A3n--02-p01887411.html','58bef94b-1ed2-4daa-8a4c-7e98f1f1d081','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('fd344045-6392-4e2f-8978-e6c7c3ab680f','Kaki',2199000.00,'100% vải cotton | 100% vải cottonLỚP LÓT','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-khoac-cropped-fit-co-nhung-tam-p00122418.html','a00364d0-5c01-40a3-b9bb-c953d0ecad15','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('fd3cae66-ca74-4855-a967-8580b08a6dd0','Màu vàng bò dịu',1399000.00,'42% sợi lyocell | 58% vải cotton','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-khoac-co-tui-%C4%91ap-p06119021.html','6e5ffdbb-ee81-4f89-95cd-0171265a93f5','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('fe107046-96cd-4145-8d71-0bc65012a1fd','Màu be nhạt',1399000.00,'70% vải cotton | 3% elastane | 97% vải cotton | 30% vải pôliexteCHI TIẾT','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-phong-vai-det-co-thuyen-p04087424.html','0b5b5bd3-2697-4443-8f51-e6a334fb0c0c','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57'),('ff015b3f-7729-4907-a9e3-970821f6679f','Màu nâu',1199000.00,'100% vải cotton','https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/ao-khoac-denim-z1975-p00108022.html','02a6ad8f-6f1e-45cd-b4ca-beab32a99668','2026-03-26 13:54:57','2026-03-26 13:54:57');
